                            "text": "Recognized with the [[Atal Bihari Vajpayee Prerna Kavya Samman 2025-26]] by 'The New Bharat' web portal on the occasion of World Hindi Day 2026, for exceptional contribution and creative expression in Hindi literature and poetry. This honor is dedicated to creativity, poetic skill, and literary contribution. Key highlights of the recognition include: ",
